<h1 class="prose">Plots</h1>
<p class="prose"><code>plot(f, a, b)</code> samples a function across a span and draws it. Like <code>map</code>, <code>iterate</code>, <code>root</code> and <code>integral</code>, it takes the <strong>name</strong> of a function — there are no lambdas, and a call's callee is always a name.</p>
